<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-100" chapter-id="c-jinshu-100-luxun-ancestry" source-id="s-jinshu-100-luxun-ancestry-ws2614279">
  <p id="c-jinshu-100-luxun-ancestry:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-100-luxun-ancestry:p001:m0000" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA**A">盧循</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-100-luxun-ancestry:p001:m0004" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA**A">於先</persName>，小名<persName id="c-jinshu-100-luxun-ancestry:p001:m0009" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA**A">元龍</persName>，司空從事中郎<persName id="c-jinshu-100-luxun-ancestry:p001:m0018" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">諶</persName>之曾孫也。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-100-luxun-ancestry:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-100-luxun-ancestry:p002:m0000" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA**A">循</persName>勢屈，知不免，先鴆妻子十餘人，又召妓妾問曰：「我今將自殺，誰能同者？」多云：「雀鼠貪生，就死實人情所難。」有云：「官尚當死，某豈願生！」於是悉鴆諸辭死者，因自投于水。<persName id="c-jinshu-100-luxun-ancestry:p002:m0084" ref="b7k_v7g_vfe_*AB">慧度</persName>取其屍斬之，及其父<persName id="c-jinshu-100-luxun-ancestry:p002:m0095" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA*A">嘏</persName>；同黨盡獲，傳首京都。</p>
</text>
